{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787620/extras/0310cef375723a040f3f15109fdf70b5.avif?t=1769223190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787620/extras_big/0310cef375723a040f3f15109fdf70b5.avif?t=1769223190 width=1560 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A\u00a0Crashed Plane, A Mysterious Island:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can\u00a0You Unravel Paradise's Darkest Secrets?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787620/extras/bb89a8381b4e116a6c0153f60a6d8465.avif?t=1769223190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787620/extras_big/bb89a8381b4e116a6c0153f60a6d8465.avif?t=1769223190 width=1560 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story\u00a0follows a\u00a0down-on-his-luck college\u00a0graduate who miraculously wins an\u00a0all-expenses-paid trip to the\u00a0newly\u00a0discovered\u00a0&quot;Paradise Island.&quot; What seems\u00a0like the ultimate\u00a0escape\u00a0from job\u00a0rejections and ramen dinners quickly turns into something\u00a0far more dangerous\u00a0when his chartered plane goes\u00a0down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded with\u00a0five beautiful women\u2014Jessica, Sophia, Scarlett, Swift, and Azami\u2014our\u00a0protagonist must navigate not only survival\u00a0but the\u00a0island's ancient mysteries. Crumbling ruins hint\u00a0at a lost civilization, strange\u00a0fruits\u00a0affect the\u00a0mind, and the island itself seems to have\u00a0plans\u00a0for its new\u00a0inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787620/extras/c2b36ccca11e